    <h2>Alumni & Community</h2>
    <p>A major stakeholder of the Christian Union is the Alumni of the Christian Union who comprise of the previous leaders and members of different generations who graduated. The alumni family is united by a fellowship called the <strong>Alumni Christian Fellowship (ACF)</strong> which provides guidance and counsel to the Christian Union in its operations.</p>

